559
00:52:51,508 --> 00:52:53,508
ご一緒に！ はいっ！
Together! Yes!

560
00:52:53,508 --> 00:52:56,208
隠しきれない熱い想いと
With burning feelings that can't be hidden,

561
00:52:56,208 --> 00:52:58,708
今を走れ 走れ
run through the present, run!

562
00:52:58,708 --> 00:53:02,008
負けない誓い一緒に掲げて行こう
Let's raise our unyielding vow together and go!

563
00:53:04,208 --> 00:53:07,008
あれやこれやと艶やかに舞う
Fascinatingly dancing this way and that,

564
00:53:07,008 --> 00:53:09,708
予感に誘われ
invited by a premonition.

565
00:53:09,708 --> 00:53:13,208
情熱は燃えて羽ばたくの
Our passion burns as we spread our wings!

566
00:53:28,408 --> 00:53:31,208
無邪気なままじゃいられない
I can't just stay innocent forever.

567
00:53:31,208 --> 00:53:34,008
切り開いて見つけたいな
I want to carve open a path and find it...

568
00:53:34,008 --> 00:53:41,208
本当も嘘もない私になって
...becoming a version of myself with no truths or lies.

569
00:53:41,608 --> 00:53:44,008
花が咲く 夢が咲く
Flowers bloom, dreams bloom!

570
00:53:44,008 --> 00:53:46,608
一度きりの物語
This is a once-in-a-lifetime story.

571
00:53:46,608 --> 00:53:49,908
やがては散り行く運命だから
Since our fate is to eventually scatter and fade,

572
00:53:49,908 --> 00:53:52,608
やるだけやるんです
we have to do all we can!

573
00:53:52,608 --> 00:53:55,408
笑いましょう 声高く
Let's laugh out loud with our voices high!

574
00:53:55,408 --> 00:53:58,008
明日の自分に届けたい
I want to send this to my future self tomorrow.

575
00:53:58,008 --> 00:54:00,808
ヤマトナデシコいつだって
A Yamato Nadeshiko will always...

576
00:54:00,808 --> 00:54:05,308
時代を彩る Dreamer
...be a dreamer coloring the era.

577
00:54:05,308 --> 00:54:08,208
無限の彼方へ
To the infinite beyond!

578
00:54:08,208 --> 00:54:10,208
ご一緒に！ はいっ！
Together! Yes!

579
00:54:10,208 --> 00:54:12,808
隠しきれない熱い想いと
With burning feelings that can't be hidden,

580
00:54:12,808 --> 00:54:15,508
今を走れ 走れ
run through the present, run!

581
00:54:15,508 --> 00:54:20,708
負けない誓い一緒に掲げて行こう
Let's raise our unyielding vow together and go!

582
00:54:20,708 --> 00:54:23,708
あれやこれやと艶やかに舞う
Fascinatingly dancing this way and that,

583
00:54:23,708 --> 00:54:26,408
予感に誘われ
invited by a premonition.

584
00:54:26,408 --> 00:54:30,208
情熱は燃えて羽ばたくの
Our passion burns as we spread our wings!

585
00:55:00,489 --> 00:55:01,489
大好きぺこ
I love you, peko!

586
00:55:01,489 --> 00:55:02,489
歌の中なら
If it's inside a song...

587
00:55:02,489 --> 00:55:03,489
声にいで
Let your voice out...

588
00:55:03,489 --> 00:55:04,489
いいのぺこ
...it's okay, peko!

589
00:55:04,789 --> 00:55:06,289
思い出が強さになった
Our memories became our strength.

590
00:55:06,989 --> 00:55:08,689
君ならは歌えるぺこ
If it's you, you can sing, peko!

591
00:55:09,789 --> 00:55:11,589
今日という過去が生まれて
With the past called "today" being born...

592
00:55:11,789 --> 00:55:13,789
未来にはどうしたいか？
...what is it you want to do in the future?

593
00:55:14,689 --> 00:55:16,189
描くんだ
Draw it!

594
00:55:16,689 --> 00:55:18,589
心からぺこらの...
From the bottom of my heart, Pekora's...

595
00:55:18,589 --> 00:55:24,189
「ありがとう」歌ってあげたいんだ
..."thank you" is what I want to sing to you!

596
00:56:03,689 --> 00:56:08,189
RADIANT FORCE
[Song: RADIANT FORCE]

597
00:56:51,789 --> 00:56:55,489
始まる歌 始まる鼓動
The beginning song, the beginning heartbeat

598
00:56:55,489 --> 00:56:59,189
響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
Resound far and wide, sound of hope!

599
00:56:59,189 --> 00:57:03,189
「生きる事」を諦めないと
"I won't give up on living,"

600
00:57:03,189 --> 00:57:06,589
示せ 熱き夢の 幕開けを
show us the curtain rise of this passionate dream!

601
00:57:06,589 --> 00:57:10,289
爆ぜよ/風よ この奇跡に嘘はない
Explode! / Blow, wind! There is no lie in this miracle!

602
00:57:29,989 --> 00:57:33,389
その手は何を掴む為にある？
What are those hands meant to grasp?

603
00:57:33,389 --> 00:57:35,989
たぶん待つだけじゃ叶わない
Surely, simply waiting won't make it come true.

604
00:57:35,989 --> 00:57:39,189
その手は何を守る為にある？
What are those hands meant to protect?

605
00:57:39,189 --> 00:57:41,389
伝う 熱は
The heat that is conveyed...

606
00:57:41,389 --> 00:57:44,989
明日を 輝かす 種火に
...becomes the spark that lights up tomorrow!

607
00:57:44,989 --> 00:57:48,589
さあ新時代へ引き金を引こう
Come, let's pull the trigger toward a new era!

608
00:57:48,589 --> 00:57:51,989
伝説の未来へとカウントダウン
Countdown to a legendary future!

609
00:57:51,989 --> 00:57:54,989
羽撃きは一人じゃない
We are not flapping our wings alone.

610
00:57:54,989 --> 00:57:56,989
過去を 超えた 先に
Beyond the past...

611
00:57:56,989 --> 00:58:03,389
創るべき歴史が咲き燃えてる
...the history we must create is blooming and burning!

612
00:58:03,389 --> 00:58:07,189
絆、心、一つに束ね
Unite our bonds and hearts as one,

613
00:58:07,189 --> 00:58:10,689
響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
resound far and wide, sound of hope!

614
00:58:10,689 --> 00:58:13,589
「信ず事」を諦めないと
"I won't give up on believing,"

615
00:58:13,589 --> 00:58:16,989
唄え 可能性に ゼロはない
sing! There is no zero in possibilities!

616
00:58:16,989 --> 00:58:19,989
飛べよ/翔べよ この奇跡に光あれ
Fly! May light shine upon this miracle!

617
00:58:28,189 --> 00:58:31,989
切り裂けまだ見ぬ日に行く為に
Tear it apart to go to the unseen days!

618
00:58:31,989 --> 00:58:34,789
不可能なんて何一つない
There is absolutely no such thing as impossible.

619
00:58:34,789 --> 00:58:37,989
こんなに心強いことはない
There is nothing more reassuring than this.

620
00:58:37,989 --> 00:58:41,389
絶対 絶対 絶対信じ合い
Absolutely, absolutely, absolutely believing in each other,

621
00:58:41,389 --> 00:58:43,989
ぶっちぎる
we will break through!

622
00:58:43,989 --> 00:58:47,189
たとえ闇に吸い込まれそうになって
Even if we're about to be sucked into the darkness,

623
00:58:47,189 --> 00:58:50,689
涙さえも血に濡れて苦しくっても
and even if our tears are stained with blood and it's painful...

624
00:58:50,689 --> 00:58:53,789
帰る場所が待っている
...the place to return to is waiting!

625
00:58:53,789 --> 00:58:56,989
集え/守れ/契れ
Gather! / Protect! / Pledge!

626
00:58:56,989 --> 00:59:02,989
勇気の結晶が奇跡なんだ
The crystallization of our courage is the miracle!

627
00:59:02,989 --> 00:59:06,389
願い、祈り、すべてを背負い
Shouldering all our wishes and prayers,

628
00:59:06,389 --> 00:59:09,689
本気を越えた本気の唄
a song of true earnestness that surpasses all limits!

629
00:59:09,689 --> 00:59:12,589
痛みなんて何も怖くない
I'm not afraid of any pain!

630
00:59:12,589 --> 00:59:15,689
滾れ 沸騰せよ このカラダ
Surge! Boil up, this body!

631
00:59:15,689 --> 00:59:18,589
翔べ さあ 闇夜に 稲妻を
Fly! Now, throw lightning into the dark night!

632
00:59:36,689 --> 00:59:40,189
出会い笑い合いそして泣きじゃくり
Meeting, laughing together, and then sobbing...

633
00:59:40,189 --> 00:59:43,389
命の炎も一緒に燃やして
...burning the flame of our lives together!

634
00:59:43,389 --> 00:59:46,689
五感の全部が叫ぶ
All of our five senses are screaming...

635
00:59:46,689 --> 00:59:49,189
愛と 呼べる ほどの
...to the extent that it can be called love,

636
00:59:49,189 --> 00:59:55,689
眩しく煌めいた友の証
the dazzlingly sparkling proof of our friendship!

637
00:59:55,689 --> 01:00:00,189
絆、心、一つに束ね
Unite our bonds and hearts as one...

638
01:00:00,244 --> 01:00:03,044
響き鳴り渡れ希望の音
Let the sound of hope resound in the air

639
01:00:03,244 --> 01:00:06,544
「信ず事」を諦めないと
It says to "Never give up on believing"

640
01:00:06,644 --> 01:00:07,644
唄え
Sing!

641
01:00:07,644 --> 01:00:08,744
可能性に
To the possibilities...

642
01:00:08,744 --> 01:00:09,744
ゼロはない
there is no zero.

643
01:00:09,744 --> 01:00:10,744
飛べよ
Fly!

644
01:00:10,744 --> 01:00:12,044
この奇跡に
Within this miracle,

645
01:00:12,044 --> 01:00:13,444
光あれ
